5,1,1,talk,Minako,,"Since our current arrangement is breaking down, we need a factual basis for a fair system. I suggest we start by reviewing the actual costs and usage patterns to see where the imbalances lie.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"I quite agree, Minako. A touch of empirical evidence should prevent us from relying on mere impressions, which are so often unreliable. Let us ensure our new foundation is built on logic rather than memory.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"I agree. To make a logical decision, we need data on how the car is actually being used and maintained. We should focus on the daily reality of the vehicle's availability and condition.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shion,,"Logic is fine, but we've been operating on guesswork for too long. I want to see the actual numbers and a clear picture of who is really behind the wheel before we decide anything.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I agree. It would be better if we had clear information. I don't want anyone to feel it's unfair, so looking at the facts seems like the right thing to do.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Minako,,"To get a clear picture of the costs, I will look into last year's tax, insurance and parking papers, as well as last year's fuel receipts. This will show us the baseline expenses.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"To complement Minako's financial approach, I shall examine what two other car-sharing households said and the spell of checking each other's figures. Perhaps a glimpse into the failures of others will save us from our own.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Asuka,,I will look into the hours of use recorded in the diary and the state of the car at handover. I want to understand the actual availability and the condition of the vehicle.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shion,,"I'll take last year's fuel receipts and the month's trial of recording every run. If we want an honest picture of usage and spending, we need the raw data, not just summaries.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,I... I think I'll look into the hours of use recorded in the diary and the trips that repeat weekly. I just want to understand how much time we actually spend managing everything.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Minako,,"It seems we have a good distribution of tasks. By combining the financial records with the usage logs, we should be able to identify exactly where the current system is failing.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"Indeed. Once we have synthesized these disparate pieces of data, we can avoid the pitfalls of emotional arguments and arrive at a solution that is as elegant as it is equitable.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"I hope we can also address the consistency of the car's condition. Data on hours is useful, but the quality of the experience when we actually start the engine is what truly matters.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shion,,"Consistency is a luxury we can't afford until the bills are sorted. Let's just make sure no one ""misremembers"" the figures when we compare notes. I'm interested to see if the reality matches the stories.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I... I hope we can find a way that makes everyone happy. I'll do my best to look into the things I chose and share what I find.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Minako,,"Let's proceed then. We have each selected our focus areas. Once we have reviewed the information, we can discuss the findings and move toward a fair, sustainable agreement.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,"A most sensible conclusion to our first round. I shall retreat into my research and await the revelations of the data. Until then, let us maintain this commendable spirit of cooperation.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Asuka,,I will do the same. I look forward to seeing how the data reflects the actual state of the car and its availability. Let's ensure we remain objective when we reconvene.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Shion,,Objectivity is easy when the numbers don't lie. I'll be waiting to see if the data reveals any surprising discrepancies. Let's see who's actually been carrying the load.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,I'll... I'll go check those things now. I hope the information helps us figure things out without any fighting. I'll see you all soon.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
